{
    "a_galaxy_workflow": "true",
    "annotation": "Metagenomics pipeline: taxonomic profiling + known ARG detection (ABRicate/CARD on contigs + GROOT/ARG-ANNOT on reads) + novel drug target discovery (antiSMASH/BiG-SCAPE/ARTS). Dataset: PRJNA781406 (glacier-fed stream biofilm, Vanishing Glaciers Project; Busi/Kohler/Battin et al. 2023, Microbiology Spectrum, PMC9927545) — switched 2026-07-12 from the original PRJNA717813 (Schönbuch Forest soil, mSystems 2021) after the forest soil sample produced zero known-ARG hits. Connects to IPK2026 #16 Transcriptomics, #17 Cheminformatics, #18 AI for Drug Discovery.",
    "comments": [],
    "creator": [
        {
            "class": "Person",
            "email": "arl.gpt01@gmail.com",
            "identifier": "",
            "name": "IPK2026 Lecture"
