        "21": {
            "annotation": "ARG NAME STANDARDIZATION via CARD ARO Gene Family mapping (CARD v3.3.0, 5,370 entries). Maps every CARD gene name to its ARO AMR Gene Family: TEM-1 → TEM beta-lactamase, TEM-15 → TEM beta-lactamase (same family → join matches correctly). Without this: TEM-1 vs TEM-15 treated as different genes → false novel drug targets. Mapping built from CARD aro_index.tsv + FASTA headers via ARO accession linking (100% coverage). Fallback: toupper() for any gene not in CARD (e.g. novel/custom DB entries). Branch: Assembly.",
            "content_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/bgruening/text_processing/tp_awk_tool/1.1.2",
