        "29": {
            "annotation": "METHOD COMPARISON (Known ARG, Branch A vs B): Join Branch A (GROOT/reads, step 28, col 1 family-normalized) vs Branch B (ABRicate/contigs, step 21, col 1 family-normalized). Unmatched=Yes (-u): ARG families detected by GROOT on raw reads but ABSENT from the assembly-based ABRicate scan = reads-only ARGs. These may reflect low-abundance/low-coverage genes that MEGAHIT failed to assemble into a contig, or genes lost at contig boundaries — a real sensitivity argument for reads-based screening. Compare with step 30 (contigs-only) for the reverse direction.",
            "content_id": "join1",
            "errors": null,
            "id": 29,
