            "annotation": "METHOD COMPARISON (Known ARG, Branch A vs B): Join Branch B (ABRicate/contigs, step 21) vs Branch A (GROOT/reads, step 28). Unmatched=Yes (-u): ARG families detected in the assembled contigs but ABSENT from the GROOT/reads scan = contigs-only ARGs. These may reflect genes GROOT's LSH-forest index missed (arg-annot database gap or divergent allele) or reads whose k-mer signal was too sparse pre-assembly. Reverse direction of step 29 (reads-only).",
