        "38": {
            "annotation": "NOVEL RESISTANCE GENE DISCOVERY: ML-based ARG prediction (DeepARG v1.0.4) on MEGAHIT contigs from a confirmed antibiotic-exposure environment. Unlike ABRicate/CARD (strict 80% identity+coverage blastn), DeepARG uses a trained neural network over Diamond alignments (--arg-alignment-identity 50, relaxed) to score ARG-likeness. Two outputs: 'ARG' (prob>=0.8, confident calls — validated vanA/U/S/R/RI glycopeptide cluster variants in this environment, 2026-08-06 local test) and 'Potential ARG' (prob<0.8) — genes that don't confidently match a known family but show ARG-like signal: these are the NOVEL CANDIDATE resistance genes this pipeline aims to surface for downstream structural characterization. → IPK2026 #17 Cheminformatics, #18 AI for Drug Discovery.",
            "content_id": "toolshed.g2.bx.psu.edu/repos/iuc/deeparg_predict/deeparg_predict/1.0.4+galaxy1",
